RKNPU2 runtime (librknnrt) — Rockchip Electronics Co., Ltd.

This directory vendors Rockchip's RKNPU2 NPU runtime (librknnrt.so) and its
public C headers, obtained from https://github.com/airockchip/rknn-toolkit2
(the rknpu2 component). The runtime is a closed-source Rockchip binary,
redistributed under Rockchip's runtime redistribution terms. It is included
unmodified, solely as a prebuilt shared object that the app links against.

